<p class="form-text" id="password-help">Use at least 12 characters (maximum 72 bytes). A long, unique passphrase is welcome. Avoid common passwords and your current password.</p><div class="auth-strength"><meter id="password-strength" min="0" max="4" low="2" high="3" optimum="4" value="0" aria-label="Estimated password strength"></meter><span id="password-strength-label" role="status">Enter a new password</span></div><p class="form-text">Passwords are checked against <a href="https://haveibeenpwned.com/Passwords" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Have I Been Pwned</a> using a partial hash. Your password is never sent.</p>
